{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんわかつきっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は夏のFree&Easyのラスト個別握手会でしたっヽ(*´∀｀)八(´∀｀*)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハロウィン前ということで\n色んな仮装メンバーが沢山(*´ ˘ `*)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな可愛かったぁぁぁぁあ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"終わった後にあった\n寧々と矢田ちゃんと京ちゃんの\n卒業ご挨拶。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただ、言えること。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46に入ってくれて本当に\nありがとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これ以上は言いません。\nこれ以外ありません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では、最後に若月の服装とヘア。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1部＆5部のコーディネート。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2014/10/18/3891460/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2014/10/18/3891460/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2部～4部はコスプレ、アリス！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2014/10/18/3891460/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2014/10/18/3891460/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ついんてーる。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2014/10/18/3891460/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アリス(若月)と執事(生駒)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2014/10/18/3891460/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アリス集合！！(橋本、みり愛、川村、若月)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2014/10/18/3891460/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いかがでしょうか？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生でみた方もおうちにいた方も\n部が違った方も 写真で楽しんで貰えたら嬉しいな(∗ˊ꒳ˋ∗)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"舞台の事、ノギビンゴ、モバメの話etc..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に\nありがとうございましたっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"声があまり出せなくて心配おかけしました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大丈夫ですっ！\nゆっくり休んで明日からの\n舞台は気力でしっかり頑張りますっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また舞台の写メや感想ブログは\n別で上げますねっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では、またの(´,,•﹏•,,｀)✳︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日からロングランっ！\n頑張りますっ(*´ ˘ `*)"}],"source":"archive"}